{"id":"n62732-1-13","stage":5,"title":"생활고 · 生活困难","scene":"工作与经济","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62732-1-13-1","ko":"한 무명 작가가 생활고에 허덕이다 결국 요절하고 말았대.","zh":"据说有个无名作家因为生活困苦而苦苦挣扎，最终英年早逝了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"한","meaning":"程度，限度，范围","explanation":"한：程度，限度，范围","readings":[{"term":"한","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84551","senseId":"3","lemma":"한","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"무명","meaning":"默默无闻，不为人知，无名","explanation":"무명：默默无闻，不为人知，无名","readings":[{"term":"무명","audio":"/audio/7b3a76de18b4fb0a7188.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"55321","senseId":"2","lemma":"무명","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"작가가","meaning":"作家","explanation":"작가：作家；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"작가","audio":"/audio/07dda968bf6b7241b33c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58277","senseId":"1","lemma":"작가","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"생활고에","meaning":"生活困难，生活之苦","explanation":"생활고：生活困难，生活之苦；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"생활고","audio":"/audio/ccafffa230d1b718d202.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62732","senseId":"1","lemma":"생활고","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"허덕이다","meaning":"挣扎，跌跌撞撞","explanation":"허덕이다：挣扎，跌跌撞撞；다：连接途中转换或接续的动作，具体要结合前后文。","readings":[{"term":"허덕이다","audio":"/audio/0337f4d98bc6b9f76765.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"85134","senseId":"1","lemma":"허덕이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"결국","meaning":"最终，最后","explanation":"결국：最终，最后","readings":[{"term":"결국","audio":"/audio/a1a5375588e265b035a5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17264","senseId":"1","lemma":"결국","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"요절하고","meaning":"夭折，早逝","explanation":"요절하다：夭折，早逝；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"요절하다","audio":"/audio/570361cbb9b16c1eefc9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68870","senseId":"1","lemma":"요절하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"말았대.","meaning":"结果还是、最终发生（-고 말다）","explanation":"말다：结果还是、最终发生（-고 말다）；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；대：口语中转述听来的话，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"말다","audio":"/audio/f8b54c8d9bfb2043a3b8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72580","senseId":"2","lemma":"말다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"89233692031a62c6","term":"한","zh":"程度，限度，范围","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3","entryId":"84551","definition":"为了某件事情，处于要牺牲个人或忍受艰难困苦的状况。","pronunciation":["한ː"]},{"id":"7b3a76de18b4fb0a","term":"무명","zh":"默默无闻，不为人知，无名","audio":"/audio/7b3a76de18b4fb0a7188.mp3","entryId":"55321","definition":"没有名声。","pronunciation":["무명"]},{"id":"07dda968bf6b7241","term":"작가","zh":"作家","audio":"/audio/07dda968bf6b7241b33c.mp3","entryId":"58277","definition":"原创出诗歌、小说、剧本、画等的人。","pronunciation":["작까"]},{"id":"ccafffa230d1b718","term":"생활고","zh":"生活困难，生活之苦","audio":"/audio/ccafffa230d1b718d202.mp3","entryId":"62732","definition":"因为贫穷而在生活中感到的痛苦。","pronunciation":["생활고"]},{"id":"0337f4d98bc6b9f7","term":"허덕이다","zh":"挣扎，跌跌撞撞","audio":"/audio/0337f4d98bc6b9f76765.mp3","entryId":"85134","definition":"很吃力，手足无措或很累。","pronunciation":["허더기다"]},{"id":"a1a5375588e265b0","term":"결국","zh":"最终，最后","audio":"/audio/a1a5375588e265b035a5.mp3","entryId":"17264","definition":"事情或状况结束的阶段。","pronunciation":["결국"]},{"id":"570361cbb9b16c1e","term":"요절하다","zh":"夭折，早逝","audio":"/audio/570361cbb9b16c1eefc9.mp3","entryId":"68870","definition":"年轻时死去。","pronunciation":["요ː절하다"]},{"id":"f8b54c8d9bfb2043","term":"말다","zh":"结果还是、最终发生（-고 말다）","audio":"/audio/f8b54c8d9bfb2043a3b8.mp3","entryId":"72580","definition":"结果还是、最终发生（-고 말다）","pronunciation":["말ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/23bd84f29870a8b7bc82.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62732-1-13-2","ko":"가난한 예술가들이 마음껏 작품 활동을 할 수 있도록 지원책이 마련되어야 해.","zh":"应该制定相应的扶持措施，让贫困的艺术家们能够自由地从事创作活动。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"가난한","meaning":"穷，穷困","explanation":"가난하다：穷，穷困；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"가난하다","audio":"/audio/0431c8b030467e77e387.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62495","senseId":"1","lemma":"가난하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"예술가들이","meaning":"艺术家","explanation":"예술가：艺术家；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"예술가","audio":"/audio/a01e058b6dfbdeceed20.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70566","senseId":"1","lemma":"예술가","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"마음껏","meaning":"尽情地","explanation":"마음껏：尽情地","readings":[{"term":"마음껏","audio":"/audio/3e973c540114102a2f05.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15717","senseId":"1","lemma":"마음껏","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"작품","meaning":"作品","explanation":"작품：作品","readings":[{"term":"작품","audio":"/audio/eec1d8d2d561e94f9208.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24837","senseId":"2","lemma":"작품","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"활동을","meaning":"活动","explanation":"활동：活动；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"활동","audio":"/audio/d4b47a5cf76094e95719.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74135","senseId":"2","lemma":"활동","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"할","meaning":"从事，经营","explanation":"하다：从事，经营；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"6","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"수","meaning":"可以，可能","explanation":"수：可以，可能","readings":[{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15615","senseId":"1","lemma":"수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있도록","meaning":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","explanation":"있다：能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）；도록：表示目的、达到的程度或促使某事发生。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"5","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"지원책이","meaning":"扶持措施、支援办法","explanation":"지원책：扶持措施、支援办法；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"지원책","audio":"/audio/d89655c9bbc97bf37d34.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"course:지원책:1","senseId":"1","lemma":"지원책","origin":"course-authored supplement"}]},{"text":"마련되어야","meaning":"筹备，安排","explanation":"마련되다：筹备，安排；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。","readings":[{"term":"마련되다","audio":"/audio/625afff5415224f9e9c3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59466","senseId":"2","lemma":"마련되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"해.","meaning":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","explanation":"하다：应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"4","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"0431c8b030467e77","term":"가난하다","zh":"穷，穷困","audio":"/audio/0431c8b030467e77e387.mp3","entryId":"62495","definition":"因没有钱而生活困难。","pronunciation":["가난하다"]},{"id":"a01e058b6dfbdece","term":"예술가","zh":"艺术家","audio":"/audio/a01e058b6dfbdeceed20.mp3","entryId":"70566","definition":"创作或表现艺术作品的人。","pronunciation":["예ː술가"]},{"id":"3e973c540114102a","term":"마음껏","zh":"尽情地","audio":"/audio/3e973c540114102a2f05.mp3","entryId":"15717","definition":"不管多少，直到心满意足。","pronunciation":["마음껃"]},{"id":"eec1d8d2d561e94f","term":"작품","zh":"作品","audio":"/audio/eec1d8d2d561e94f9208.mp3","entryId":"24837","definition":"画、雕刻、小说、诗等通过艺术创作活动制成的东西。","pronunciation":["작품"]},{"id":"d4b47a5cf76094e9","term":"활동","zh":"活动","audio":"/audio/d4b47a5cf76094e95719.mp3","entryId":"74135","definition":"为在某事中取得好结果而努力。","pronunciation":["활똥"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"从事，经营；应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"拥有某种职业或运营某种事业。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"dcd19f5b5caac977","term":"수","zh":"可以，可能","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3","entryId":"15615","definition":"做某事的能力，或某事发生的可能性。","pronunciation":["수"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"d89655c9bbc97bf3","term":"지원책","zh":"扶持措施、支援办法","audio":"/audio/d89655c9bbc97bf37d34.mp3","definition":"为帮助某人或某项活动而制定的措施。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"625afff5415224f9","term":"마련되다","zh":"筹备，安排","audio":"/audio/625afff5415224f9e9c3.mp3","entryId":"59466","definition":"为预防某个情况而整理好了计划或想法。","pronunciation":["마련되다","마련뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/690b01bfe28580d9a3dc.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":7.122,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=62732","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":179,"sequenceScore":6.9487,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["据说有个无名作家因为生活困苦而苦苦挣扎，最终英年早逝了。","应该制定相应的扶持措施，让贫困的艺术家们能够自由地从事创作活动。","由于担心体罚会带来严重的不良影响，政府已经出台了禁止教师体罚的法案并已生效。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["据说有个无名作家因为生活困苦而苦苦挣扎，最终英年早逝了。","应该制定相应的扶持措施，让贫困的艺术家们能够自由地从事创作活动。","由于担心体罚会带来严重的不良影响，政府已经出台了禁止教师体罚的法案并已生效。"],"answer":1}]}
